# code-is-decision root — per-CRL `code is` lowering (rx501-147-shaped)
library "Code Is Decision".

// A single library carrying a `decision` (which disqualifies the layered
// auto-split — see layeredEmit `isLayerableLibrary`) PLUS two `code is`-only
// concepts. Because the decision keeps the whole library on the PER-CRL path,
// the synthetic terminology and its concept co-reside in ONE emitted library,
// so detectCollisions suffixes the code name to "<X> Code" and the retrieve
// inlines as `[<Resource>: "<X> Code"]`. This is the motivating per-CRL case.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.

concept "Active Crohns Disease":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `active-crohns-disease`.

activity "Refer to GI":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage Crohns":
- when "Active Crohns Disease" then recommend activity "Refer to GI".
